---
/* FLYER PROMO — 2 Nov, client note: "after the hero the flyer eases in
  (like all those promotion thing that pops on the screen) with a cancel
  button but on the flyer theres a clear 'save a seat' button (keep that
  hover effect)."

  This is the other half of removing the hero card. That card made the ask
  on the first screen, competing with the wordmark; the ask now arrives
  once, on its own, the moment you leave the hero.

  Native <dialog> + showModal(), same as the speaker bios: the focus trap,
  Escape and the top layer are the platform's job rather than hand-rolled.

  "Keep that hover effect" -- the button is literally the same `.cta btnfx`
  the hero card used, so the ink wipe-fill and the flare label are the same
  component, not a reimplementation. Flare budget is unchanged on this page
  too: the hero card's flare CTA went away as this one arrived, so home
  still runs the nav's Register plus one, inside COLOUR_SYSTEM's cap.

  Shown ONCE per session (sessionStorage) -- a promo that reopens every
  time you scroll past is the thing everyone hates about these. */
---
<dialog class="promo" id="flyerPromo" aria-label="No Bushels, 21 November 2026, Warri">
  <div class="promo__panel">
    <button type="button" class="promo__close" id="promoClose" aria-label="Close">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M6 6 L18 18 M18 6 L6 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
    </button>

    <img class="promo__flyer" src="/img/flyer-no-bushels.webp"
         width="900" height="1125"
         alt="No Bushels, a Christian creative conference presented by The Glow Tribe. Saturday 21 November 2026, Warri, Delta State. Free entry, registration required."
         decoding="async">

    <!-- the ask, sitting on the flyer itself. Same .cta .btnfx as the old
         hero card, so the wipe-fill hover is the same object. -->
    <a class="cta btnfx promo__cta" href="/conference#event">
      <span>Save a seat</span> <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</dialog>
